<Layouts.flash_group flash={@flash} />
<div class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 py-20 space-y-6">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Goatmire</h1>
  <p class="text-base-content/80">
    Minimal Ash Framework learning app with three UIs for the same authors/posts domain:
    Phoenix LiveView, Hologram, and Gleam/Lustre. All three can update across browser tabs.
  </p>
  <p class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <a href={~p"/blog"} class="btn btn-primary">LiveView /blog</a>
    <a href="/hologram" class="btn btn-secondary">Hologram /hologram</a>
    <a href={~p"/gleam"} class="btn btn-accent">Gleam /gleam</a>
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">
    Database: SQLite via AshSqlite (see README). For Hologram in dev, start with
    <code>mix holo</code> (sets <code>HOLOGRAM_START=1</code>). Gleam assets build with
    <code>mix assets.gleam</code> (or as part of <code>mix assets.build</code>).
  </p>
</div>
